Z||000000||rockcrawl||07-21-2000||04:07 PM||||I guess it's kinda like the Jeep wave. I always wave to passing Fieros, and they usually wave or toot back. It's like a big family of proud Fiero owners!<P>Jon Lagler<P>------------------<BR>'86 GT 3800<BR>'87 GT<BR>Rossa Spyder (under construction)||||reg||7
